&lt;p class="0" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(95, 102, 119); font-family: Noto Sans KR, dotum, 돋움, vernade, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;- 동일한 지원 혜택 적용&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;본 사업은 추가경정예산으로 진행되는 사업으로&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;기존 본 사업과 지원 내용 및 혜택이 동일합니다&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-indent: -5pt; font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
